          "code": "def connect(host, port=5432, timeout=30):   # 原生语法，不用写重载\n    ...\n\n# ⚠ 与 Java 最危险的一处差异：默认值只在定义时求值一次\ndef collect(item, bucket=[]):\n    bucket.append(item)\n    return bucket\n\n# 正统写法：用 None 当哨兵\ndef collect(item, bucket=None):\n    bucket = [] if bucket is None else bucket\n    bucket.append(item)\n    return bucket",
